# Color applet: "Color Palette >>" (Tab, Space), then the Screen Element combo (Down: Application
# Workspace), the Basic Colors grid (Tab: focus rectangle; Right Right Down) and Space on the focused
# box. Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/color-palette.scn (the rig's run timed out before its last
# frame); compare in 16 colours (W16_COLORS=16).
# regress: W16_COLORS=16 sh tools/run-cp-test.sh "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: color-palette/02.png 02.png active
# compare: color-palette/03.png 03.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: color-palette/04.png 04.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: color-palette/05.png 05.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: color-palette/06.png 06.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
sleep 400
shot shots/01.png
key enter
sleep 400
shot shots/02.png
key tab
key space
sleep 400
shot shots/03.png
key down
sleep 400
shot shots/04.png
key tab
sleep 400
shot shots/05.png
key right
key right
key down
sleep 400
shot shots/06.png
key space
sleep 400
shot shots/07.png
quit
